<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.98 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.98 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 1.98 billion zlotys worth of Polish T-bills at the Treasury's 700 million zloty primary auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Results of the tender are expected later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
